2026-09-22 23:46:22,913 | INFO | [ackman] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=71565 tokens_out=394 tokens_cached_in=44350 tokens_uncached_in=27215 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=71959 latency_ms=5006 first_event_latency_ms=878 tool_calls=3 observability_warnings=0 summary="Based on the provided research and financial evaluation of the universe (`GOOGL`, `CMG`, `UBER`, `HLT`), here is the concentrated bull case for the strategy:  1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)**: Alphabet remains a dominant force across search, cloud computing (Google Cloud), and artificial intelligence infrastructure. With extraordinary free cash flow generation, a fortress balance sheet, and leadership in foundational AI models and hardware, GOOGL offers exceptional compounding at an attractive valuation relative to its technological moats and digital advertising dominance. 2. **Chipotle Mexican Grill (CMG)**: Chipotle features a best-in-class unit economics model, robust digital integration, and significant domestic and international expansion runway. Its strong pricing power, high margins, and customer loyalty provide durable top-line growth and earnings compounding even amid macro volatility. 3. **Uber Technologies (UBER)**: Uber has successfully transitioned from a high-burn disruptor to a highly profitable platform leader spanning mobility and delivery. Network effects create a powerful two-sided marketplace moat, while operating leverage, disciplined capital allocation, and expanding free cash flow unlock substantial medium-term upside. 4. **Hilton Worldwide Holdings (HLT)**: Hilton's asset-light, high-fee franchise and management model generates exceptional return on capital and resilient cash flows across economic cycles. With a massive global pipeline, industry-leading loyalty program, and disciplined capital return program, HLT provides premium compounding with lower cyclical downside.  RESULT: Argued the concentrated bull case across the high-quality research universe (GOOGL, CMG, UBER, HLT) per instructions without submitting any orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/47dc7260818837f68c4a70338b3d665c6484e6a5b2a9ec90b92c06c388794a37-20260923034622886750.json
