1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)**: Alphabet remains a dominant force across search, cloud computing (Google Cloud), and artificial intelligence infrastructure. With extraordinary free cash flow generation, a fortress balance sheet, and leadership in foundational AI models and hardware, GOOGL offers exceptional compounding at an attractive valuation relative to its technological moats and digital advertising dominance.
