2026-09-22 23:47:19,755 | INFO | [ackman] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=20907 tokens_out=349 tokens_cached_in=16176 tokens_uncached_in=4731 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=21256 latency_ms=1958 first_event_latency_ms=1957 tool_calls=0 observability_warnings=1 summary="Based on the research and financial evaluation of the core portfolio universe (`GOOGL`, `CMG`, `UBER`, `HLT`) as of January 6, 2026, here is the concentrated bull case for each holding:  1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)**: Alphabet possesses unrivaled moats across search, digital advertising, and enterprise cloud infrastructure (Google Cloud). Backed by an industry-leading position in artificial intelligence development and hardware integration, Alphabet generates massive free cash flow and maintains a fortress balance sheet, offering compounding growth at an attractive valuation. 2. **Chipotle Mexican Grill (CMG)**: Chipotle features best-in-class unit economics, industry-leading margins, and strong pricing power. With robust digital integration and a vast runway for both domestic and international store expansion, CMG delivers durable top-line growth and resilient earnings compounding across economic cycles. 3. **Uber Technologies (UBER)**: Uber has cemented its status as the dominant global platform for mobility and delivery. Its powerful two-sided marketplace network effects, combined with accelerating operating leverage and disciplined capital allocation, drive expanding free cash flow and substantial medium-term upside. 4. **Hilton Worldwide Holdings (HLT)**: Hilton's asset-light franchise and management fee model generates exceptional returns on invested capital and highly resilient cash flows. Supported by a massive global development pipeline, world-class loyalty programs, and a disciplined shareholder return framework, HLT represents a premier long-term compounder.  RESULT: Argued the concentrated bull case across the research universe (`GOOGL`, `CMG`, `UBER`, `HLT`) per instructions without submitting any orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/b7809f3d956e2d91e7de4f42a85118cebad67c0f9e0149d9635c2767fd08033b-20260923034719721781.json
