1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)**: Alphabet remains a dominant economic powerhouse anchored by unparalleled moats in search, digital advertising, and enterprise cloud computing (Google Cloud). Its leadership across foundational artificial intelligence models, custom silicon, and Android ecosystem integration provides an extensive runway for technological and commercial outperformance. Backed by a fortress balanc...
